  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FVMAf7A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"364\"><br></span></strong></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">簡介</span></strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Sledgehammers </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">加入了</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"> 7 種新的破壞槌物品。破壞槌 </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">是多功能工具，<strong>對於任何方塊都非常有效。</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">當蓄力並釋放時，</span> <span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">破壞槌可以</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">挖掘、連鎖挖礦和砍倒樹木。</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">每個原版工具等級都有對應的</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">破壞槌</span>: </strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">木、石、鐵、金、鑽石、獄髓。 </span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">最後一個等級稱為</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">「星光」</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">，是一種難以製作但</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">永不損壞的破壞槌。</span></strong></span></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>模組包政策</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>你可以在任何模組包中使用此模組，無論是公開還是私人。只是不要將此模組宣稱為你自己的作品！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
